  "remarks": "Andrey Schneider is a Russian entrepreneur, the co-founder and co-owner of the Svetofor Group, which runs over 2 200 discount stores in Russia and abroad under brands such as Svetofor, Mere, and MyPrice. The family-owned business involves his brother Sergey and mother Valentina. The company is structured through hundreds of LLCs under the Torgservice Group of Companies brand. Andrey Schneider is also the co-founder of Torgservice Group of Companies, which runs the Svetofor discount chain.",
